config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_BATTERY_LEVEL
	bool "Domoticz plugin: BatteryLevel"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PAHO_MQTT
	default n
	help
		monitoring of the battery level of the devices, with notifications on the thresholds (it connects to the MQTT broker with paho-mqtt).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/BatteryLevel, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> BatteryLevel, enter the MQTT broker and the devices to follow.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
